Chapter: TorchZipMachine
  cites AI chapter SafeTensors
  cites AI chapter TorchZip

 The TorchZip pickle machine over pickles built byte by byte: one valid state
 dict, and each hostile form the allowlist exists to refuse, which must be
 refused by name (docs/Designs/Active/Apps/MusicGen.md, ruling 1).

 We say:

